Not fully implemented or simplified:

- The arcade’s exact entry choreography for all 40 enemies is approximated with curved Bezier entry groups.
- The tractor-beam capture behavior for a dual fighter is simplified: one half can be captured and the player continues as a single fighter.
- Captured-fighter scoring and some edge cases from the original arcade are not fully faithful.
- Stage flag denominations use a greedy 50/30/20/10/5/1 representation with repeated denominations and fall back to a text stage label for very large stage numbers.
- Some Galaga-specific timing details, such as exact dive selection weights and exact challenging-stage wave composition, are approximations.
